  contactDamage: 1
  description: A grey figure that walks to be struck, dragging its yoke uphill both
    ways. Its penance is your weakness for hitting it.
  tactics: 'CURSED - killing it applies WEAKNESS (-1 bullet damage) for four seconds.
    It never shoots; it just weaves fast through your line of fire like a confession
    you did not ask for. Fire discipline: shoot around it, or accept dull steel at
    a safe moment.'
